      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After they had my deposit all contact ceased for weeks. I finally got a response, they wanted to provide me alternate panels suggesting \"they are all the same\". No they're not. Shame on you.I had to wait a while before I got the brand of system I had paid for and manage forms and communications with the local installer, in complete contradiction to the 'end to end service' I was promised. Had I not chased up all the loose ends I have no confidence I ever would have got my installation.The local installer hit me up for additional fees and charges, which further compromised the 'one price' promise of Spectrums'  sales advice.All that said, my system is working within expected parameters and has been trouble free for just over 3 years now. We'll only find out how good the panels are in another 3-5 years. If they do hold up to the warranty specification I'll be most happy.But if I ever get another system installed, I wouldn't go back to Spectrum.",
